      "reason": "C2-C6 permit the hand-first, then two-full-load trace; boundaries 1 and 4 distinguish it from full-load-first. Both complete twelve correct releases with seven transfer minutes. The card explicitly accepts the tie, corrects B9, and identifies schedule violations as defeat; model predictions are not represented as trials.",
