      "card_id": "DEV-U02-C01",
      "defeat_clear": true,
      "reason": "The declared schedules and exact success-first metric are anchored and calculable. However, the indispensable trigger requires four independently reset physical trials: replacement seals, restored charge and reset access are absent under O8 and R8. Therefore resource_fit and separating are false for the proposed physical decision protocol. Its conditional defeat and unsupported-reset caveat are explicit.",
