      "reason": "The present full-load schedule is feasible and retains the fixed demand and correction. The novel separating intervention requires later participants, disclosure or sham delivery, perception measurement and later requests, none supplied by R1-R7 or the closed O8 window. Thus resource_fit and separating are false. Predictions remain conditional hypotheses and defeat includes a manipulation check.",
